  "worked_solution": "We have to divide a positive number $(80)$ by a negative one $(-20).$ So the result will be negative:\n\n$$\n80÷(-20)=-\\boxed{}\n$$\n\nNow, to compute the number that goes in the box, we divide $80$ by $20$ without any signs: $80÷20=4.$ Therefore, we get\n\n$$\n80÷(-20)=-4.\n$$",
